What "the Software" covers here, so that reading the artifact raises no
question the terms do not answer:

`dist/fathohm.cjs` is one bundled file, and the scoring, authorship and
rendering modules it was compiled from are inside it. They are part of the
Software above and carry the same MIT grant. Those scoring modules are the
same ones the hosted service at https://fathohm.dev runs — a score you
cannot re-derive is a black box, and this tool is meant to be audited.

The bundle ships unminified with its comments for that reason. To read it:

    npm pack fathohm && tar -xzf fathohm-*.tgz && less package/dist/fathohm.cjs

No other part of the Fathohm product is licensed by this file.
